    assets:broker:aapl            0 AAPL
    assets:broker:cash               $2.40
    income:dividends

2024-03-01 Fidelity | cash sweep interest
    assets:broker:cash               $1.12
    income:interest

2024-03-20 * Fidelity | FXAIX dividend reinvested
    assets:broker:fund            0.5 FXAIX @ $180.00
    income:dividends               $-90.00

2024-03-25 * Fidelity | VTI dividend paid to checking
    assets:broker:vti             0 VTI
    assets:bank:checking            $11.60
    income:dividends

2024-04-01 * Fidelity | FXAIX moved in from old employer plan
    assets:broker:fund            20 FXAIX @ $175.00
    equity:transfers

2024-04-12 * Wise | buy euros
    assets:bank:euro              500,00 EUR @ $1.08
    assets:bank:checking

2024-04-20 * Lyon | hotel
    expenses:travel               200,00 EUR
    assets:bank:euro

2024-05-10 * Fidelity | sell AAPL (partial)
    assets:broker:aapl           -4 AAPL @ $183.20  ; name: Apple Inc.
    expenses:fees                    $4.95
    assets:broker:cash

2024-06-03 * Fidelity | sell VTI (close position) to checking
    assets:broker:vti            -8 VTI @ $235.50
    assets:bank:checking         $2,000.00
    income:gains

2024-06-25 Fidelity | move AAPL to IRA in kind
    assets:broker:aapl           -2 AAPL
    assets:ira                    2 AAPL
